Subject: [PATCH v6 5/6] scsi: scsi_transport_sas: Cap shost opt_sectors according to DMA optimal limit
Date:   Thu, 14 Jul 2022 19:15:28 +0800
Message-ID: <1657797329-98541-6-git-send-email-john.garry@huawei.com>
